  "description": "Bsa.Search.Core is a .Net Core library providing indexing and fast full text search. Technical characteristics of approximately 100 thousand simple queries per minute, on the index of 40 million documents, or about 8 thousand complex queries",
  "iconFile": "BSAsearch_logo_white.png",
